Description: IIO accelerometer sensor to input device proxy (with Snapdragon SSC support)
 IIO sensors to D-Bus proxy compiled with Snapdragon Sensor Core (libssc)
 support for Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu). Provides auto-rotation and ambient light
 brightness to GNOME and KDE desktops.
